OL,3,GNEWSACompulsory purchase urged for Hull
OL,4,Aflats
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil officers have recommended using
OL,7,Fcompulsory purchase powers to acquire a
OL,8,Fblock of flats and help complete the
OL,9,Fredevelopment of part of Fruit Market
OL,10,Fin Hull.
OL,12,FA Hull City Council report said
OL,13,Fdeveloper Wykeland Beal had been trying
OL,14,Fto buy Pier Court since 2021 without
OL,15,Fsuccess.
OL,17,FIn recommending councillors approve a
OL,18,Fcompulsory purchase order (CPO),
OL,19,Fofficers said redeveloping the site
OL,20,Fwould "deliver a significant
OL,21,Fimprovement to the area".
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
