OL,3,GNEWSACompulsory purchase urged for Hull
OL,4,Aflats
OL,5,
OL,6,FQueensway Properties Limited said it
OL,7,Fhad owned Pier Court for 20 years but
OL,8,Fthe council had never contacted it
OL,9,Fabout the building or the proposed
OL,10,Forder. It said it believed the case for
OL,11,Fcompulsory purchase was based on "facts
OL,12,Fthat are wrong or out of date".
